UPSTREAM ORIGIN AND MODIFICATIONS
---------------------------------

This project is a fork of:

    easyeda2kicad.py
    Copyright (C) uPesy <contact@upesy.com>
    https://github.com/uPesy/easyeda2kicad.py
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0

The conversion engine under `easyeda2kicad/` derives from that work and has
been modified. In accordance with section 5(a) of the AGPL, the significant
changes are recorded here:

  2025    Forked from upstream. Added a template system that merges curated
          KiCad symbols and footprints with EasyEDA-sourced data.
  2025    Added a Chrome extension front end (`chrome_extension/`) that drives
          the conversion from LCSC product pages.
  2026    Replaced the HTTP/WebSocket backend with a Chrome Native Messaging
          host (`native_host/`). The engine is now invoked in-process rather
          than served over a socket.
  2026    Added symbol/footprint SVG preview rendering, a confidence-driven
          import model with persisted per-category rules, property whitespace
          normalisation, and a pin-to-pad mapping layer.

Generator strings written into exported KiCad files credit this project rather
than the upstream, because the emitted footprints and 3D models derive from
EasyEDA data. `tests/test_generator_string.py` guards that boundary.


